      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This post addresses the same issue, but has a different focus:\nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/avatar-30/p/feedback-control-the-not-sync-parameters-from-expressions-menu\nIts also 1 1/2 years old and this is even more relevant now with the in-beta OSC feature...",
